-- New A1.2 grammar topics 9-12 (Course Factory Wave 3, PR A).
--
-- What: adds four A1.2 grammar topics -- stem-changing-verbs, imperative, perfekt-intro, dative-prepositions-intro --
-- at topic_order 9-12. (sub_level, topic_order) stays UNIQUE and untouched.
-- Why: A1.2 grows from 8 to 12 topics, mirroring A1.1's PR #68 growth to 12.
-- grammar_topics_topic_order_check is already 1..12 (widened by PR #68 for
-- A1.1); the ALTER TABLE pair below re-applies the same 1..12 range, which is
